by its own author. This repository is two steps removed from whoever holds those
rights, and cannot speak for either layer.

## Why not CC-BY-4.0

This file previously carried the verbatim CC-BY-4.0 text. Applying CC-BY-4.0
asserts that this repository holds rights it can grant onward. It does not.
**The absence of a stated restriction upstream is not a grant of rights** — it
is silence, and silence cannot be relicensed.

What this repository can say is narrower and true: the capture adds a retrieval
timestamp and a parse. Neither creates a new right over the underlying values.

